%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f0ee082b9462944eaa7a29918420727, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 672940032
    m_Localized: Attention. Containment failure, Pod Row 3. Holding is on lockdown. All personnel to the nearest secure room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 714883072
    m_Localized: Handler teams to Row 3. Sedation rounds authorized. Do not engage alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 714883073
    m_Localized: Holding is sealed. Nothing leaves that block. Nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 714883074
    m_Localized: Warden unit offline in Holding. Repeat, the Warden is down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271680
    m_Localized: It went through the Warden like it was nothing. Pull everyone back. Now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271681
    m_Localized: So. You're awake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271682
    m_Localized: I know what woke you. She calls to all of you. None of the others ever answered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271683
    m_Localized: That drone was built to hold you. Nothing here was built to hold you for long. I learned that once already.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271684
    m_Localized: Go back to your pod, and I'll make this painless. Go down, and I won't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271685
    m_Localized: Bio-Labs, this is Security. Specimen breach on Level 1. Lock the theatres and stay inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271686
    m_Localized: 'All surgical staff: secure your samples first. Then yourselves.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271687
    m_Localized: Med-Drones deploying to Bio-Labs. Lab Security, hold the corridors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271688
    m_Localized: The Automaton in Theatre 1 is not responding. Containment, confirm status.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271689
    m_Localized: Theatre 1 is gone. The Automaton's gone. It's heading for the lower levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271690
    m_Localized: 'All stations: specimen moving between levels. Seal the stairwells. Seal everything.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271691
    m_Localized: Warning. Security relay offline, {0}. One of three.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271692
    m_Localized: Second security relay offline, {0}. Boss containment door at reduced power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271693
    m_Localized: All security relays offline, {0}. Containment door unsealed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271694
    m_Localized: That machine opened up dozens of your kind. I suppose that makes this personal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271695
    m_Localized: You're going down. Toward her. Of course you are.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271696
    m_Localized: Every level below this one was built for things worse than you. Keep going. Let's see what you become.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271697
    m_Localized: Specimen Holding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271698
    m_Localized: Bio-Labs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271699
    m_Localized: Test Sector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271700
    m_Localized: PA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271701
    m_Localized: RADIO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723271702
    m_Localized: DR. CRANE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748712849408
    m_Localized: 'Intake memo: Subject [REDACTED]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763968
    m_Localized: Dr. Elias Crane, Chief Scientist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763969
    m_Localized: "SITE BETA \xB7 CONTAINMENT DIRECTIVE 14-C\r\nTo: Specimen Holding, all shifts\r\nFrom: Dr. Elias Crane, Chief Scientist\r\nRe: Subject \u2588\u2588\u2588, revised containment protocol\r\n\r\nEffective immediately, Subject \u2588\u2588\u2588 moves to Pod Row 3 under continuous sedation. Field strength is not to drop below 92% for any reason, including scheduled maintenance. Handlers carry shock poles at all times inside the row.\r\n\r\nThis subject has outlived every previous specimen in its line. That makes it valuable, not safe. If its readings spike, you call me before you call security.\r\n\r\nApproved: E. Crane"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763970
    m_Localized: Pod history
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763971
    m_Localized: J. Pike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763972
    m_Localized: "POD MAINTENANCE RECORD \xB7 ROW 3, UNIT 12\r\n\r\nOccupant history:\r\n\r\n- Subject \u2588\u2588\u2588: terminated, failed neural response\r\n- Subject \u2588\u2588\u2588: terminated, attempted containment breach\r\n- Subject \u2588\u2588\u2588: transferred to Bio-Labs (dissection)\r\n- Subject \u2588\u2588\u2588: terminated, unstable growth\r\n- Subject \u2588\u2588\u2588: transferred to Cold Storage\r\n- Subject \u2588\u2588\u2588: CURRENT\r\n\r\nMaintenance note: Pod seals replaced after every occupant. Residue in the drainage channel doesn't respond to standard solvents. Burn it out.\r\n\r\nUnit sign-off: J. Pike"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763973
    m_Localized: 'Pod label: Progenitor-derived'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763974
    m_Localized: Night Technician R. Osei
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763975
    m_Localized: "SPECIMEN TAG \xB7 POD ROW 3, UNIT 12\r\nOrigin: Progenitor-derived (direct offspring)\r\nSedation: Continuous. Do not interrupt.\r\nFeeding: Biomass ration B, every 6 hours. Use the tongs.\r\n\r\nNotes: Responds to Progenitor stimulus. When samples from the Vault come within twenty meters, motor activity triples and the subject turns toward the floor. Every time, it points down, toward the lower levels. Cause unknown. Recommend routing samples around Holding until we understand why.\r\n\r\nTag updated by Night Technician R. Osei"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763976
    m_Localized: Night shift chat log
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763977
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763978
    m_Localized: "[INTERNAL CHAT \xB7 HOLDING NIGHT SHIFT]\r\n\r\nPIKE: row 3 is twitching again\r\nDIAZ: hit it with the pole, it settles\r\nPIKE: did. twice. it looked at me\r\nDIAZ: they don't look at you, they don't have eyes\r\nPIKE: then what was that\r\nDIAZ: overtime is what that was. want to swap to Admin, swap to Admin\r\nPIKE: and lose hazard pay? no thanks\r\nDIAZ: then hit it a third time and log it as routine\r\nPIKE: logged\r\nDIAZ: see. easy money"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763979
    m_Localized: Sibling termination report
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763980
    m_Localized: Dr. T. Tran
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763981
    m_Localized: "TERMINATION REPORT \xB7 BIO-LABS THEATRE 1\r\nSubject: \u2588\u2588\u2588 (offspring line, first generation)\r\nCause: Scheduled termination after failed obedience trial\r\nMethod: Neural severance under full sedation\r\nTime to death: 11 minutes (exceeds projection)\r\n\r\nObservations: Subject stayed responsive throughout. Before death it reached a tendril toward the floor drain and held it there. Same orientation as previous subjects: down, toward the Vault. Remains sent to tissue storage. Neural tissue sent to Dr. Crane's private lab on request.\r\n\r\nFiled by: Dr. T. Tran"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763982
    m_Localized: Tissue sample source
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763983
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763984
    m_Localized: "SAMPLE REQUISITION \xB7 BIO-LABS / VAULT\r\nRequested: 40 g Progenitor tissue (dorsal mass)\r\nPurpose: Brood stimulation, Theatre 1\r\nApproved: E. Crane\r\n\r\nVault technician's note, attached:\r\nExtraction took four hours. She didn't fight it this time. Her vitals dropped again during the procedure and took longer to come back. I've asked twice whether we should slow the harvest schedule. The answer is always the same: she heals, so keep cutting. If she stops healing, who signs that off?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763985
    m_Localized: Surgeons' betting pool
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763986
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763987
    m_Localized: "THEATRE 1 POOL \xB7 WEEK 31\r\nHow long does the new one last on the table?\r\n\r\n- Okoye: 40 min ($20)\r\n- Halvorsen: under 30 ($20)\r\n- Tran: won't make it to the second incision ($50)\r\n- Mbeki: an hour, it's a tough one ($10)\r\n\r\nLast week's winner: Tran (again). Pot carries over if it lasts past 2 hours.\r\n\r\nReminder: no betting on Dr. Crane's personal cases. He doesn't find it funny."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763988
    m_Localized: Dissection schedule
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763989
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125748775763990
    m_Localized: "BIO-LABS \xB7 WEEKLY THEATRE SCHEDULE\r\n\r\n- Mon: Subject \u2588\u2588\u2588, full dissection (neural mapping)\r\n- Tue: Subject \u2588\u2588\u2588, partial (limb regrowth study)\r\n- Wed: Theatre 2 cleaning. Do not skip the drains.\r\n- Thu: Subject \u2588\u2588\u2588, termination and dissection. Obedience trial failed.\r\n- Fri: Open\r\n\r\nNote from Dr. Crane: Any subject that fails two obedience trials goes on Thursday's list. I don't want them housed, fed or studied any further. We are not running a zoo. We are building something that listens. Fill Friday."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131941162303488
    m_Localized: 'SPECIMEN 41 [TRANSLATED]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131941195857920
    m_Localized: '*click-click* The little one comes. Shiny things, yes? Bring, and Forty-One trades.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131941195857921
    m_Localized: '*tk-tk* You smell of the Warden. Good. Show me what you carry.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131941195857922
    m_Localized: '*skrrt* Bigger now. Hungrier. Forty-One has what hungry things want.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131941195857923
    m_Localized: '*chk* Wear it well. Grow.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131941195857924
    m_Localized: '*hss* Not enough. Eat more of them, then come back.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131941195857925
    m_Localized: '*click* Nothing for you yet. Bring me keys. Things that open.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 389866183213056
    m_Localized: Administration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 389866199990272
    m_Localized: Quarantine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 389866199990273
    m_Localized: Research Division
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 389866199990274
    m_Localized: Cold Storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 389866199990275
    m_Localized: Barracks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 389866199990276
    m_Localized: Armory & Weapons Testing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 389866199990277
    m_Localized: Command Center
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 389866199990278
    m_Localized: Deep Containment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 389866199990279
    m_Localized: Black Site
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 389866199990280
    m_Localized: Mother's Vault
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 524257370849280
    m_Localized: Containment failure in Mother's Vault. All personnel, evacuate Site Beta.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 524257391820800
    m_Localized: Biological growth detected in every sector. Lockdown failing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 524257391820801
    m_Localized: Overwatch, this is Barracks. It's in the walls. It's everywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 524257391820802
    m_Localized: Site Beta is lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484791271424
    m_Localized: Obedience trials
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631552
    m_Localized: Audio log, Dr. Elias Crane
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631553
    m_Localized: Session forty-one. The subject responded to the tone on nine of ten presentations. Nine of ten. Command keeps asking me for a weapon, and I keep telling them a weapon that does not listen is a disaster with a fuse. Alpha taught us that. What we are building here is not a predator. It is a hive that sits when told to sit, and bites when told to bite. Obedience first. Everything else is breeding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631554
    m_Localized: 'Vital signs: Progenitor'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631555
    m_Localized: Automated monitor, Vault feed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631556
    m_Localized: "PROGENITOR \xB7 WEEKLY SUMMARY\r\nCore temperature: 31.2 \xB0C (down 0.4)\r\nNeural activity: 62% of baseline (down 5)\r\nTissue regeneration after extraction: 71 hours (up 9)\r\n\r\nTrend: declining. Recommend reducing extraction frequency.\r\n\r\nRecommendation overridden by: E. CRANE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631557
    m_Localized: Bonus memo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631558
    m_Localized: Human Resources, Research Division
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631559
    m_Localized: 'Congratulations, Research Division! Thanks to your hard work, quarterly bonuses are tied directly to program milestones. Each viable subject reaching Phase 3 earns the responsible team a 4% salary bonus. Each successful obedience trial adds 1%. Terminations do not count against you. Keep up the great work, and remember: results speak louder than paperwork.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631560
    m_Localized: 'Behavioral trial: failed subject'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631561
    m_Localized: Audio log, trial room 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631562
    m_Localized: Subject 288, trial nine. Tone presented. No response. Tone presented again. The subject is looking at the glass. It is looking at me. Note that the subject has stopped eating. Dr. Crane, do you want to continue? ... Understood. Termination authorized at 14:02. For the record, it did not try to escape. It just kept looking at the glass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631563
    m_Localized: Cryo request denied
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631564
    m_Localized: Dr. Elias Crane, Chief Scientist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631565
    m_Localized: 'Re: Proposal CS-112, Progenitor stasis.



      Denied. I understand the medical team''s concerns about her decline, but a frozen Progenitor produces nothing. Every week she is awake is another clutch. She is far too valuable to sleep. Increase the nutrient drip and continue the extraction schedule as written.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631566
    m_Localized: Alpha specimen transfer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631567
    m_Localized: Cold Storage intake ledger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484820631568
    m_Localized: "INBOUND FROM SITE ALPHA SALVAGE\r\nCrates 1 to 14: tissue, unidentified, sealed under Protocol Ash.\r\nCrates 15 to 19: specimens, deceased (?), keep below -60 \xB0C.\r\nCrate 20: DO NOT OPEN.\r\n\r\nNote from the dock crew: crate 20 knocked twice during unloading. Sent it straight to Bay 7. Nobody wants to sign for it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020160
    m_Localized: Frozen brood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020161
    m_Localized: Inventory, Cryo Bay 4
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020162
    m_Localized: 'Bay 4 holds 46 brood units in suspended development, stage 2 to 4. Units are labeled by clutch and kept for later trials if the current generation underperforms. Thawing takes six hours. Thawed units that fail to revive within a day are to be logged as ''spoiled'' and incinerated. Reminder: do not tap on the glass. They can feel it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020163
    m_Localized: Medical exemption
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020164
    m_Localized: Medical officer, Command Center
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020165
    m_Localized: Dr. Crane has again declined his quarterly medical review, citing Command clearance. I have the exemption on file, but I want it noted that he has a visible tremor in his left hand and has lost weight. Staff report he books Isolation Room C for 'private sessions' twice a week. Nobody else is allowed in. Nobody has seen what he brings with him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020166
    m_Localized: 'Classified directive: Alpha'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020167
    m_Localized: Military command, eyes only
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020168
    m_Localized: The board of inquiry has concluded that the Site Alpha breach began in Dr. Crane's laboratory as a direct result of his unauthorized trials. This finding is sealed. The official cause remains equipment failure. Dr. Crane's work is too valuable to lose to a court-martial. He is to be given Site Beta and every resource he asks for. He is not to know this file exists.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020169
    m_Localized: Officer's commendation list
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020170
    m_Localized: Base commander
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020171
    m_Localized: "For outstanding service to the Hive Program this quarter:\r\n\xB7 Sgt. Holloway, 14 specimen recaptures, zero losses\r\n\xB7 Lt. Ames, Range B efficiency record\r\n\xB7 Dr. Crane's team, first fully obedient Phase 3 subject\r\n\r\nCommand extends its gratitude. The program is the future of this nation's security. Drinks in the officers' mess on Friday."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020172
    m_Localized: Program statistics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020173
    m_Localized: Program office, quarterly report
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020174
    m_Localized: "HIVE PROGRAM \xB7 CUMULATIVE\r\nSubjects bred: \u2588\u2588\u2588\r\nReached Phase 2: 41%\r\nReached Phase 3: 6%\r\nPassed obedience trials: 2%\r\nTerminated: \u2588\u2588\u2588\r\nCurrently held: 1\r\n\r\nTotal count redacted per directive 9. Survival rate is within projected tolerances."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020175
    m_Localized: 'Personnel file: Dr. Elias Crane'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020176
    m_Localized: Human Resources, Administration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020177
    m_Localized: 'Name: Dr. Elias Crane

      Previous post: Site Alpha, Senior Biologist

      Status: one of seven Alpha survivors

      Promotion: Chief Scientist, Site Beta, effective immediately

      Clearance: unrestricted



      Note: promotion approved by Command without the usual review period. Psych evaluation waived. HR objections withdrawn on request.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020178
    m_Localized: Recovery report
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020179
    m_Localized: Recovery team lead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020180
    m_Localized: We found the vessel half buried in the salt flats, still warm. Something inside was alive. It took four teams and a crane barge to pull it out. The creature inside was enormous and badly hurt, bleeding something that ate through two pairs of gloves. It did not fight us. I think it was trying to protect something under its body. Command classified the site before we finished the paperwork.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020181
    m_Localized: Alpha incident summary (official)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020182
    m_Localized: Public affairs office
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020183
    m_Localized: On the night of the incident, a cascading equipment failure in Site Alpha's power systems caused a fire and structural collapse. Regrettably, most personnel were lost. There was no biological release. Site Alpha has been permanently sealed. All staff are reminded that discussing the incident outside official channels is a breach of contract.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020184
    m_Localized: Survivor roster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020185
    m_Localized: Site Alpha incident file
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020186
    m_Localized: "CONFIRMED SURVIVORS, SITE ALPHA\r\n1. Pvt. D. Okonkwo, security, deceased six weeks later\r\n2. R. Fisk, maintenance, missing\r\n3. Dr. E. Crane, biology\r\n4. Dr. M. Sato, biology, retired on medical grounds\r\n5. L. Ortega, logistics\r\n6. \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\r\n7. \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\r\n\r\nOf 212 staff on site. Survivors debriefed separately. Accounts did not agree."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020187
    m_Localized: Employee of the month
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020188
    m_Localized: Administration notice board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020189
    m_Localized: This month's Employee of the Month is Gerald Pike from Specimen Handling! Gerald processed 31 terminations in a single week, a new site record, with zero paperwork errors. When asked for his secret, Gerald said, 'You just stop thinking of them as anything.' Congratulations, Gerald! Your reserved parking space awaits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020190
    m_Localized: 'Personal recording: ''It listens to me now'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020191
    m_Localized: Audio log, Dr. Elias Crane
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020192
    m_Localized: I put my hand on the culture today and it moved toward me. Not away. Toward. The tissue knows me now. It knows what I carry in my blood. They think the obedience trials are about the subjects. They never understood. The hive does not need a master that it fears. It needs a master that is part of it. It listens to me now. Soon, all of it will.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020193
    m_Localized: Transfer to the Vault
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020194
    m_Localized: Logistics order, Deep Containment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020195
    m_Localized: 'Transfer order DC-9: the Progenitor is to be moved from Bio-Labs Theatre 1 to the Deep Vault beneath Black Site. Route via freight elevator 3, sedation doubled for transit. Reason given: ''security after the specimen escapes in Holding.'' The Vault has three independent security systems and one door. Dr. Crane holds the only key.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020196
    m_Localized: 'Excavation note: sealed tunnel'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020197
    m_Localized: Dig foreman, Deep Containment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020198
    m_Localized: 'Hit concrete at 412 m, west face. Old construction, not ours. There is a stencil on it: SITE ALPHA, ACCESS 6, SEALED. The crew does not want to dig any further. Two of them say they hear scratching through the wall at night. I told them it is water. I don''t believe it either. Requesting permission to reroute.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020199
    m_Localized: Self-trial log
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020200
    m_Localized: Audio log, Dr. Elias Crane
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020201
    m_Localized: Injection eleven. Dosage tripled. The tremor is gone. The pain is not, but pain is information. My skin is changing along the left arm. The tissue has taken. I can feel the Progenitor's heartbeat through the floor when I sleep. When she dies, and she will die soon, the hive will need a new mother. I will be ready. I will be what Alpha should have made.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020202
    m_Localized: Crane's private account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020203
    m_Localized: Audio log, Dr. Elias Crane
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020204
    m_Localized: For the record, since no one else will keep one. Alpha was mine. I opened the containment early because I was sure I could control what I had grown. I was wrong. Two hundred people. I heard every one of them. I have spent every day since trying to build a hive that obeys, because if it obeys, then Alpha was a mistake I fixed, not a massacre I caused.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020205
    m_Localized: Clone program
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020206
    m_Localized: Black Site project summary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020207
    m_Localized: 'Project MIRROR attempted to grow obedient soldiers from preserved sibling tissue instead of fresh clutches. Results: clones are fast, aggressive and completely unreliable. They attack handlers and each other. Surviving clones are kept in the lower pens for disposal or field testing. Project suspended. Tissue stock reassigned to Dr. Crane''s personal use.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020208
    m_Localized: Field medic's notes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020209
    m_Localized: Audio log, recovery team medic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020210
    m_Localized: She was dying when we found her. Massive trauma from the crash, organs I don't have names for shutting down. I got her stable. I was proud of that, for about a day. Then I saw the extraction schedule. We didn't save her life. We saved a supply. I asked to be transferred off the program. They sent me to Quarantine instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020211
    m_Localized: Quarantine protocol rationale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020212
    m_Localized: Quarantine design brief
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020213
    m_Localized: 'Quarantine''s layout applies every lesson from the Alpha incident: double airlocks, sealed vents, acid flush systems, and incinerators on every wing. If containment fails, the wing is to be burned with staff inside. This is not a punishment. It is arithmetic. Alpha lost 205 people because no one was willing to close a door.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020214
    m_Localized: Hazmat crew complaint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020215
    m_Localized: Union rep, Quarantine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020216
    m_Localized: 'Formal complaint on behalf of Hazmat Crew B: three double shifts this week, no hazard pay for the incinerator wing, and the coffee machine on level 2 has been broken since spring. We also request better gloves, as the current ones dissolve on contact with subject fluids. The crew has no objection to the work itself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020217
    m_Localized: 'Weapons test: Alpha countermeasures'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020218
    m_Localized: Armory test report
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020219
    m_Localized: 'Flame Corps equipment was designed from Alpha footage: hive tissue regenerates from almost any wound except burns. Incendiary rounds and flamethrowers reduce regrowth by 90%. Recommend every security post below L1 carries fire. If the hive ever gets out again, we will not make the mistake of shooting it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020220
    m_Localized: 'Range log: live targets'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020221
    m_Localized: Range B, Armory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020222
    m_Localized: 'Range B, Tuesday. Live targets supplied by Specimen Handling: 6 Phase 2 subjects. Test: new rail rifle at 40 m. Targets 1 to 4 neutralized in one shot. Target 5 required three. Target 6 hid behind the berm and had to be flushed with fire. Note to supply: please send faster targets, the current ones barely run.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020223
    m_Localized: 'Requisition: Crane priority'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020224
    m_Localized: Barracks quartermaster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020225
    m_Localized: 'All requests from Dr. Crane take priority over Barracks supply, including ammunition and medical stock. Per Command: Crane has promised a deployable hive weapon within eighteen months, and Command wants it. If your unit runs short, file a complaint with Command. Do not file it with Dr. Crane. The last person who did was transferred to Quarantine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020226
    m_Localized: Soldier's letter home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020227
    m_Localized: Audio log, Pvt. Marsh
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020228
    m_Localized: Hey Mom. Can't tell you where I am, but it's important work. We're keeping people safe from things you wouldn't believe. Some of the guys get rattled, but I sleep fine. I know whose side I'm on. Tell Danny I'll bring him something cool for his birthday. Maybe a tooth. They're everywhere down here. Love you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020229
    m_Localized: Live-fire subject requisition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020230
    m_Localized: Barracks training office
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020231
    m_Localized: 'Requesting 12 juvenile subjects for live-fire training next month. Juveniles preferred: they behave unpredictably, which makes for better drills. Specimen Handling may substitute siblings from failed clutches. Please keep them sedated for transport and wake them only at the range.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020232
    m_Localized: Final vitals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020233
    m_Localized: Automated monitor, Vault
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020234
    m_Localized: "PROGENITOR \xB7 LIVE\r\nCore temperature: 26.8 \xB0C\r\nNeural activity: 9% of baseline\r\nHeart rate: irregular\r\nResponse to stimuli: one, at 02:14, toward the Vault door\r\n\r\nWARNING: subject is not expected to survive another extraction cycle.\r\nNext extraction: scheduled."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020235
    m_Localized: Subject registry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020236
    m_Localized: Program office, Vault archive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584484829020237
    m_Localized: "HIVE PROGRAM \xB7 MASTER REGISTRY\r\n...\r\nSubject 309: terminated, Phase 2\r\nSubject 310: terminated, obedience trial\r\nSubject 311: terminated, clone stock\r\nSubject 312: ACTIVE, Specimen Holding, Pod Row 3\r\n\r\nSubjects 1 to 311: the Progenitor's offspring. All destroyed.\r\nSubject 312: the last."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592055074816
    m_Localized: Administration, this is Security. The specimen has left Holding. Seal your offices and stay away from the glass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017856
    m_Localized: Vance here. Nobody runs. My people hold the atrium. That thing gets no further than this floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017857
    m_Localized: Security Chief Vance is not responding. All Security units, fall back to the transit doors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017858
    m_Localized: Vance thought a baton and a shield made him a wall. You've been eating walls since you hatched.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017859
    m_Localized: 'Research Division: specimen on Level 1. Lock down the trial rooms. Protect the data first.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017860
    m_Localized: Okafor, suit up. If it gets into the archive we lose ten years of work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017861
    m_Localized: The exo-suit's down. Dr. Okafor is... she's not in it anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017862
    m_Localized: She designed half the trials your siblings failed. Did you recognize her smell?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017863
    m_Localized: Quarantine breach. Decontamination cycles suspended. Hazmat crews, hold your wings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017864
    m_Localized: Do not open the Seeper's pit. I don't care what's scratching at the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017865
    m_Localized: Pit biological no longer reading. Quarantine, report.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017866
    m_Localized: The Seeper was one of my first. It never learned to obey. Neither did you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017867
    m_Localized: Cold Storage temperature alarm. All bays to emergency cooling. Keep the cryo locks shut.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017868
    m_Localized: Loader crew, get the mech to the bay doors. If that thing thaws anything, we're done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017869
    m_Localized: Loader's down and the bay doors are open. The cold's getting out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017870
    m_Localized: Your brothers and sisters are frozen in there. Leave them. They failed. You're the only one who still matters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017871
    m_Localized: Barracks, alert status one. All squads to the armory lifts. This is not a drill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017872
    m_Localized: Major Ross has the walker on the parade ground. Fall in behind it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017873
    m_Localized: The walker's burning. Major Ross is down. Somebody tell Command.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017874
    m_Localized: Ross promised Command he could kill anything I bred. A soldier's promise. Worth exactly what it cost them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017875
    m_Localized: 'Armory and Weapons Testing: specimen on Level 2. Flame Corps to the live-fire range.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017876
    m_Localized: Captain Reyes, burn it. Burn everything it touches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017877
    m_Localized: Flame Corps are down. The range is on fire. Reyes is gone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017878
    m_Localized: Fire was the one thing we learned from Alpha. And you walked through it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017879
    m_Localized: Command Center lockdown. Overwatch has control of every door on this level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017880
    m_Localized: Overwatch, reconfigure the halls. Trap it. Don't let it reach the freight elevator.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017881
    m_Localized: Overwatch core offline. Manual door control only. Repeat, Overwatch is offline.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017882
    m_Localized: You've blinded the whole base. Now there's only you, me, and the dark between us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017883
    m_Localized: Deep Containment. Excavation crews, stop digging. Specimen inbound from the freight shaft.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017884
    m_Localized: Get the rig between it and the lower tunnels. Whatever's down there stays down there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017885
    m_Localized: Rig's wrecked. The tunnel's open. Something's moving on Alpha's side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017886
    m_Localized: You're closer to her now. Can you hear her? She's slowing down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017887
    m_Localized: Black Site. Radiation shielding at maximum. Unauthorized personnel will be terminated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017888
    m_Localized: This is my floor. Everything you've seen above was the rough draft.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017889
    m_Localized: Reactor control lost. Radiation venting. Black Site, evacuate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017890
    m_Localized: The Vault is below us. She's waiting. So am I.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017891
    m_Localized: Vault access breach. Security systems one through three engaged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017892
    m_Localized: Three hundred and eleven came before you. I watched every one of them die. You're the last, and you're mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017893
    m_Localized: Sentry Titan is down. It shelled itself to pieces. How is that thing still alive?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017894
    m_Localized: 'Incinerator wing: biological mass no longer detected. Furnaces still burning.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017895
    m_Localized: The Many was everything we threw away. And you ate it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017896
    m_Localized: Hunter-Killer team, report. Hunter-Killer team, respond. ... Nobody's answering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 588592097017897
    m_Localized: Command's best. I told them to send more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
